bview refresh, status and lifecycle contracts.","Replace or explain ac1/ac2/ac3 in the acceptance mapping: the originating ISSUE contains prose fix intent rather than numbered acceptance criteria. The listed tests otherwise map to its execution, recovery and unsupported-selection obligations.","Retain protocol and policy qualification before deployment. The documented default-only fallback, unchanged catalog RPC and absence of data migration are consistent across sections.","Provide a retrievable structural-map citation and complete visual inspection before closing the review."]}],"progress":{"status":"incomplete","phase":"complete","completedChunks":5,"totalChunks":5,"lastMeaningfulActivityAt":null,"activeToolCount":0,"requiresUserInput":false,"checkpointPath":"/Users/subhagho/work/projects/insors/insrc/.insrc/tmp/design-review/catalog-model-effort-lld-97adabf6.json","sequence":0,"reviewElapsedMs":0,"unitElapsedMs":null,"observedAt":"2026-11-09T16:53:00.041Z","freshness":"stored"},"startedAt":"2026-11-09T16:41:37.277Z","reviewer":"daemon","model":"gpt-6.1-sol","unit":{"unitId":"consistency","phase":"chunk_review","executionId":"b07ebd5d-e024-4ae2-982f-8fcdfb3faeca","dispatches":1,"retriesUsed":0,"userDirectedDispatches":0,"diagnostics":[]},"plan":{"chunks":[{"id":"scope","title":"Issue traceability, scope and design assumptions","selectors":["/body/hldContextSlice","/body/summary","/body/interactionWithShared","/body/openQuestions","/citations/0","/citations/1","document:line:25"],"concerns":["Compare the live and canonical LLD with the originating ISSUE reproduction, root cause and fix intent; assess functional completeness, scope, non-goals and acceptance traceability.","Check standalone issue ancestry and metadata without requiring an Epic or HLD; assess whether empty shared-interaction and open-question sections accurately reflect implementation dependencies.","Verify cited analysis evidence where available and identify assumptions requiring protocol qualificat