bstantive assessments were reconciled against the originating ISSUE and unchanged live/canonical LLD. The design covers the reported symptoms and fix intent; no additional distinct defect was demonstrated. Existing findings vibe-001, chat-001 and chat-002 remain blocking. Citation provenance and actual diagram rendering remain unverified, so the overall assessment is incomplete.","findings":[],"inspectedReferences":["/Users/subhagho/work/projects/insors/insrc/docs/standalone/apply-catalog-model-effort-choices-daemon-E2026110997adabf6/S001/LLD.md","/Users/subhagho/work/projects/insors/insrc/.insrc/tmp/design-review/catalog-model-effort-lld-97adabf6.json","/Users/subhagho/work/projects/insors/insrc/.insrc/artifacts/LLD-97adabf6bd47b036-s1.json","/Users/subhagho/work/projects/insors/insrc/docs/standalone/apply-catalog-model-effort-choices-daemon-E2026110997adabf6/ISSUE.md","/Users/subhagho/work/projects/insors/insrc/.insrc/artifacts/ISSUE-97adabf6bd47b036.json","/Users/subhagho/work/projects/insors/insrc/docs/standalone/apply-catalog-model-effort-choices-daemon-E2026110997adabf6/S001/sequence-diagram.html","src/agent/providers/cli-provider.ts:309","vscode-plugin/src/chat/chat-panel.ts:110","vscode-plugin/src/chat/session-store.ts:294","vscode-plugin/src/chat/cli-adapter.ts:1023","vscode-plugin/esbuild.mjs","Checkpoint completedChunks: scope, vibe, chat, visuals; live and canonical SHA-256 fingerprints match the attempt baseline."],"limitations":["The scope assessment could not locate the structural-map bundle cited as s1:structural-map. Its contents and provenance remain unverified; current code corroboration does not verify that citation.","The visuals assessment reported that browser access was unavailable. Companion source and descriptive tables agree with the canonical definition, but actual Mermaid rendering, layout and clipping remain unverified."],"advice":["Resolve vibe-001 by defining dispatch certainty and guarding every daemon retry boundary; cover lost turn