owledgement or post-acceptance transport failure. Extend the design to preserve and propagate typed dispatch errors through this wrapper without retrying or wrapping them, and cover both failure cases through completeStructured(). Keep successful-response schema correction distinct from transport-failure replay.","evidenceReferences":[".insrc/artifacts/LLD-97adabf6bd47b036-s1.json#/body/contractDetails/api/0/postconditions/3",".insrc/artifacts/LLD-97adabf6bd47b036-s1.json#/body/testStrategy/testLevels/1/subjects","src/agent/providers/cli-provider.ts:455 — completeStructuredVibe uses withStructuredRetry around runVibe","src/agent/providers/structured-output.ts:230 — catches provider errors without a dispatch-state guard","src/agent/providers/structured-output.ts:252 — continues to another attempt","src/agent/providers/structured-output.ts:277 — wraps the final error","src/agent/providers/__tests__/cli-vibe.test.ts — existing structured-completion retry tests"]}],"inspectedReferences":["/body/contractDetails","/body/dataModelChanges","/body/errorPaths","/body/testStrategy","/body/migration","/body/alternativesConsidered","/body/chosenAlternative","/body/alternativesConsidered/0","/body/alternativesConsidered/1","/citations/2","/citations/3","/citations/4","/citations/5","/citations/6","/Users/subhagho/work/projects/insors/insrc/docs/standalone/apply-catalog-model-effort-choices-daemon-E2026110997adabf6/S001/LLD.md","/Users/subhagho/work/projects/insors/insrc/.insrc/artifacts/LLD-97adabf6bd47b036-s1.json","/Users/subhagho/work/projects/insors/insrc/docs/standalone/apply-catalog-model-effort-choices-daemon-E2026110997adabf6/ISSUE.md","/Users/subhagho/work/projects/insors/insrc/.insrc/tmp/design-review/catalog-model-effort-lld-97adabf6.json","src/assets/models/cloud-model-catalog.json","src/daemon/model-definitions.ts:147","src/agent/providers/cli-provider.ts:309","src/agent/providers/cli-provider.ts:455","src/agent/providers/cli-provider.ts:502","src/agent/providers/cli