ts__/chat-panel.test.ts:8228 — restored selections and subsequent turn requests"],"limitations":[],"advice":["When implementing bounded recovery, exercise a socket that connects but never replies. Existing IpcClient.reachability() and rpc() calls supply no deadline; ensure both probes and catalog requests settle and release resources so single-flight recovery cannot stall.","Include disposal/reopen with an outstanding refresh, repeated ready handshakes, and reachable-daemon definitions failures in the integration fixture. Assert unchanged session identity, transcript, saved selection and active-turn state.","Update the existing Vibe effort note in chat-panel.ts:2504, which currently calls the selection informational and points to saved configuration, to reflect verified session-only application."]},{"chunkId":"visuals","status":"incomplete","summary":"Inspected all assigned selectors, the originating ISSUE, sequence companion source, and relevant lifecycle code. All four participants and nine messages agree with the generated companion. The sequence is consistent with the detailed recovery and dispatch contracts at its summary level. Actual rendering verification remains unavailable.","findings":[{"id":"visuals-001","severity":"LOW","location":"docs/standalone/apply-catalog-model-effort-choices-daemon-E2026110997adabf6/S001/LLD.md:109","message":"The sequence link uses a repository-relative path as a Markdown-relative URL. Resolving it from LLD.md duplicates the document directory and targets a nonexistent file, so ordinary Markdown navigation cannot open the companion. Use ./sequence-diagram.html for document-relative navigation.","evidenceReferences":["LLD.md:109 — Sequence diagram link","The companion exists at the repository-root-resolved path; the document-relative target does not exist.","sequence-diagram.html — its ./LLD.md backlink resolves correctly."]}],"inspectedReferences":["/body/sequenceDefinition","/body/companions","/body/sequenceDefinition/participa