eckpoint attempt 1: completed scope, vibe, chat, visuals and consistency assessments, report and historical finding origins","Checkpoint attempt 2: accepted completed scope, vibe, chat and visuals assessments; impact mapping and carriedFindingIds","src/agent/providers/cli-provider.ts:455","src/agent/providers/structured-output.ts:199","vscode-plugin/src/chat/chat-panel.ts:110","vscode-plugin/src/chat/session-store.ts:294","src/shared/ipc-client.ts:225","src/daemon/model-definitions.ts:147"],"limitations":["The fresh vibe assessment could not corroborate the local loopback probe claimed in /body/contractDetails/api/0/postconditions/4. No retained script, protocol transcript, effective-selection result or configuration comparison establishes the claimed successful session-only mutation without a configuration rewrite. Source feasibility does not verify that execution claim.","The fresh visuals assessment could not inspect the actual sequence-diagram.html rendering because browser access was unavailable. Companion source agrees with the canonical definition, but successful Mermaid rendering, readability, layout and clipping remain unverified."],"advice":["Address current finding vibe-002: propagate dispatch errors through completeStructuredVibe()/withStructuredRetry() without replay or wrapping, and cover lost acknowledgements and post-acceptance failures through completeStructured(). This complements the named completion, edit and review retry guards.","Retain current LOW finding visuals-001 concerning the document-relative companion link; it is not duplicated here.","The replacement catalog citation resolves the earlier structural-map citation gap. Local ac1/ac2/ac3 meanings now trace to the ISSUE's execution, recovery, compatible-selection and explicit-failure obligations.","Preserve protocol and caller-policy qualification before deployment. The default headless fallback, unchanged persisted selection and catalog RPC shapes, transient process/session ownership and mixed-release ordering are consistent across the current sections."],"findingDecisions":[{"source":{"attempt":1,"chunkId":"vibe","findingId":"vibe-001"},"rationale":"Carry pending complete fresh verification. The revision adds typed dispatch certainty, transitions, guards for the three originally named retry boundaries and regression subjects. However, the accepted fresh vibe assessment is incomplete because the claimed probe lacks corroborating evidence, so it cannot support resolution or supersession. Its distinct finding vibe-002 also demonstrates a remaining retry boundary outside the revised enumeration.","evidenceReferences":[".insrc/artifacts/LLD-97adabf6bd47b036-s1.json#/body/contractDetails/api/0/postconditions/3",".insrc/artifacts/LLD-97adabf6bd47b036-s1.json#/body/contractDetails/api/0/postconditions/4",".insrc/tmp/design-review/catalog-model-effort-lld-97adabf6.json — attempt 2 accepted vibe assessment, finding vibe-002 and probe limitation","src/agent/providers/cli-provider.ts:455","src/agent/providers/structured-output.ts:230"],"action":"carry"},{"source":{"attempt":1,"chunkId":"chat","findingId":"chat-001"},"rationale":"The revised signature supplies Provider explicitly, defines the provider-keyed catalog projection and retains the existing RunConfig persistence shape. Reconciliation now covers new-chat, set-run-config and restoration, with atomic session updates and authoritative validation before a turn. The accepted fresh chat inspection passed without mandatory gaps.","evidenceReferences":[".insrc/artifacts/LLD-97adabf6bd47b036-s1.json#/body/contractDetails/api/1/signature",".insrc/artifacts/LLD-97adabf6bd47b036-s1.json#/body/contractDetails/api/1/parameters",".insrc/artifacts/LLD-97adabf6bd47b036-s1.json#/body/contractDetails/api/1/postconditions/2","vscode-plugin/src/chat/session-store.ts:294",".insrc/tmp/design-review/catalog-model-effort-lld-97adabf6.json — attempt 2 accepted chat assessment"],"action":"resolved","reviewedInChunkIds":["chat"]}