nce companion source, and relevant lifecycle code. All four participants and nine messages agree with the generated companion. The sequence is consistent with the detailed recovery and dispatch contracts at its summary level. Actual rendering verification remains unavailable.","findings":[{"id":"visuals-001","severity":"LOW","location":"docs/standalone/apply-catalog-model-effort-choices-daemon-E2026110997adabf6/S001/LLD.md:109","message":"The sequence link uses a repository-relative path as a Markdown-relative URL. Resolving it from LLD.md duplicates the document directory and targets a nonexistent file, so ordinary Markdown navigation cannot open the companion. Use ./sequence-diagram.html for document-relative navigation.","evidenceReferences":["LLD.md:109 — Sequence diagram link","The companion exists at the repository-root-resolved path; the document-relative target does not exist.","sequence-diagram.html — its ./LLD.md backlink resolves correctly."]}],"inspectedReferences":["/body/sequenceDefinition","/body/companions","/body/sequenceDefinition/participants/0","/body/sequenceDefinition/participants/1","/body/sequenceDefinition/participants/2","/body/sequenceDefinition/participants/3","document:line:107","/Users/subhagho/work/projects/insors/insrc/docs/standalone/apply-catalog-model-effort-choices-daemon-E2026110997adabf6/S001/LLD.md","/Users/subhagho/work/projects/insors/insrc/.insrc/artifacts/LLD-97adabf6bd47b036-s1.json","/Users/subhagho/work/projects/insors/insrc/docs/standalone/apply-catalog-model-effort-choices-daemon-E2026110997adabf6/ISSUE.md","/Users/subhagho/work/projects/insors/insrc/docs/standalone/apply-catalog-model-effort-choices-daemon-E2026110997adabf6/S001/sequence-diagram.html","/Users/subhagho/work/projects/insors/insrc/.insrc/tmp/design-review/catalog-model-effort-lld-97adabf6.json","vscode-plugin/src/chat/chat-panel.ts:326 — catalog ownership and existing HTML replacement","vscode-plugin/src/chat/chat-panel.ts:3119 — ready handshake","vscode