 assigned selectors were inspected. The live and canonical LLD align with the originating ISSUE’s reproduction, root cause and fix intent. Expanded execution and chat contracts remain within scope, and acceptance mappings cover the reported defects. The replacement catalog citation is retrievable and supports its claim, resolving the prior citation limitation. No blocking scope or traceability defect was demonstrated.","findings":[],"inspectedReferences":["/body/hldContextSlice","/body/summary","/body/interactionWithShared","/body/openQuestions","/citations/0","/citations/1","document:line:25","/Users/subhagho/work/projects/insors/insrc/docs/standalone/apply-catalog-model-effort-choices-daemon-E2026110997adabf6/S001/LLD.md","/Users/subhagho/work/projects/insors/insrc/.insrc/artifacts/LLD-97adabf6bd47b036-s1.json","/Users/subhagho/work/projects/insors/insrc/docs/standalone/apply-catalog-model-effort-choices-daemon-E2026110997adabf6/ISSUE.md","/Users/subhagho/work/projects/insors/insrc/.insrc/artifacts/ISSUE-97adabf6bd47b036.json","/Users/subhagho/work/projects/insors/insrc/.insrc/tmp/design-review/catalog-model-effort-lld-97adabf6.json","src/daemon/model-definitions.ts:39-74","src/daemon/model-definitions.ts:104-154","src/assets/models/cloud-model-catalog.json:43-57","src/agent/providers/cli-provider.ts:715","vscode-plugin/src/chat/cli-adapter.ts:1023","vscode-plugin/src/chat/chat-panel.ts:110","vscode-plugin/src/chat/chat-panel.ts:326-336","vscode-plugin/src/chat/chat-panel.ts:3190-3239","vscode-plugin/src/chat/session-store.ts:294","vscode-plugin/src/extension.ts:880","src/shared/ipc-client.ts:149"],"limitations":[],"advice":["Clarify that empty parent-contract and shared-interaction sections mean no parent-HLD or sibling obligations. Existing catalog IPC, execution adapters, session storage and extension/webview dependencies still apply and are described in the detailed contracts."]},{"chunkId":"vibe","status":"incomplete","summary":"Inspected every assigned selector. The installed Vibe source supports the proposed initialization, session-only configuration, alias identity and runtime read-back approach. The revised contract addresses the three named transient retry boundaries, but omits the structured-completion retry wrapper. The claimed local probe could not be corroborated from retained evidence.","findings":[{"id":"vibe-002","severity":"MED","location":"/body/contractDetails/api/0/postconditions","message":"The retry contract and regression matrix omit completeStructuredVibe(), which invokes runVibe() through withStructuredRetry(). That wrapper catches ordinary provider errors, converts them into validation feedback, and submits another prompt; it does not consult dispatchState. Consequently, adding the specified guards to complete(), runEditSession() and runReviewSession() still leaves an explicit-selection structured call able to replay a prompt after a lost acknowledgement or post-acceptance transport failure. Extend the design to preserve and propagate typed dispatch errors through this wrapper without retrying or wrapping them, and cover both failure cases through completeStructured(). Keep successful-response schema correction distinct from transport-failure replay.","evidenceReferences":[".insrc/artifacts/LLD-97adabf6bd47b036-s1.json#/body/contractDetails/api/0/postconditions/3",".insrc/artifacts/LLD-97adabf6bd47b036-s1.json#/body/testStrategy/testLevels/1/subjects","src/agent/providers/cli-provider.ts:455 — completeStructuredVibe uses withStructuredRetry around runVibe","src/agent/providers/structured-output.ts:230 — catches provider errors without a dispatch-state guard","src/agent/providers/structured-output.ts:252 — continues to another attempt","src/agent/providers/structured-output.ts:277 — wraps the final error","src/agent/providers/__tests__/cli-vibe.test.ts — existing structured-completion retry tests"]}],"inspectedReferences":["/body/contractDetails","/body/dataModelChanges","/body/errorPaths","/body/te